- `GET /api/v1/admin/inventory/transfers/{transferId}` - Get transfer
- `POST /api/v1/admin/inventory/transfers/{transferId}/receive` - Receive transfer
- `POST /api/v1/admin/inventory/adjustments` - Create adjustment

